WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.336
Guys, you ever see
a photo in the news and think,

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:04.871
"That headline
could be much better"?

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.272
Well, I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.874
It's time for
"News and Improved."

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.642
[ Applause ]

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:14.813
-♪ News and improved ♪

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:17.283
-For example, check out
this first photo here.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.154
The original headline was,
"Biden Signs Executive Order."

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.922
That headline
can definitely be improved.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.590
'Cause if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.027
the headline could have been...

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.932
[ Applause ]

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.101
Check out this next photo here.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.436
The original headline was,

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.371
"Warren Attends
Senate Confirmation."

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.239
But if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.075
the headline could have been...

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.547
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.951
"Oh, that's crazy."

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.187
Up next, this headline says...

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.358
Headline could have been,
"Britain's Health Secretary

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:01.127
Announces, 'It's-a me, Mario!'"

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:04.030
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.398
Pretty big announcement.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:08.368
Next headline was, "Boris
Johnson Unveils School Program."

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.204
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.273
Headline could have been...

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.178
I'd watch that.
I'm excited for that one.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:23.049
Up next, this headline says,
"Djokovic Wins Australian Open."

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.951
Headline could have been...

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.756
It's a beautiful thing.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:34.427
Next headline was,
"Biden Addresses Economy."

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.463
Headline could have been...

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.770
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.241
What? The headline
could have been that?

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.043
-Yeah.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.611
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.979
-"Deer scat."

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:56.649
This next headline was,
"Spring Training Kicks Off."

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.384
Headline could have been...

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:03.723
That is all the time we have
for "News and Improved."

